@startuml
title TITLE

' A register laid out field by field. salt draws the table;
' the comment column says what each field means.
salt
{#
  . | Bits  | Field     | Access | Meaning
  . | 31:16 | RESERVED  | ro     | Reads as zero
  . | 15:12 | MODE      | rw     | Operating mode, 0 to 15
  . | 11:8  | PRESCALER | rw     | Clock divider
  . | 7     | IRQ_EN    | rw     | Interrupt enable
  . | 6     | OVERFLOW  | rc     | Set on overflow, cleared on read
  . | 5:1   | COUNT     | ro     | Current count
  . | 0     | ENABLE    | rw     | Enable the peripheral
}

@enduml
